<speech id="uk.org.publicwhip/westminhall/2017-11-30b.242.0" speakername="Karen Buck" person_id="uk.org.publicwhip/person/10075" colnum="242" time="16:23:00" url="">
    <p pid="b242.0/1">On behalf of us all, I thank the two signers, Sally McGreavey and Richard Law. We greatly appreciate their work.</p>
    <p pid="b242.0/2">Question put and agreed to.</p>
    <p pid="b242.0/3">Resolved,</p>
    <p pid="b242.0/4" class="indent" pwmotiontext="yes">That this House has considered deafness and hearing loss.</p>
    <p pid="b242.0/5">Sitting adjourned.</p>
</speech>
